msgstr ""
"Minūtes pēc pusnakts, kad pielāgotais grafiks pārslēdzas uz gaišo stilu."

#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.gschema.xml:28
msgid "Dark style time"
msgstr "Tumšā stila laiks"

#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.gschema.xml:29
msgid ""
"Minutes after midnight when the custom schedule switches to the dark style."
msgstr ""
"Minūtes pēc pusnakts, kad pielāgotais grafiks pārslēdzas uz tumšo stilu."

#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.gschema.xml:33
msgid "Last known location"
msgstr "Pēdējā zināmā atrašanās vieta"

#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.gschema.xml:34
msgid ""
"Latitude and longitude from GeoClue, used for sunrise and sunset. Out of "
"range values mean none is known, and the system time zone gives the location."
msgstr ""
"GeoClue platums un garums, ko izmanto saullēktam un saulrietam. Ārpus "
"diapazona vērtības nozīmē, ka neviena nav zināma, un sistēmas laika josla "
"norāda atrašanās vietu."

#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.metainfo.xml.in:4
msgid "Switchcraft"
msgstr "Switchcraft"

#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.metainfo.xml.in:6
#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.metainfo.xml.in:8
msgid "Arnis Kemlers"
msgstr "Arnis Kemlers"

#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.metainfo.xml.in:9
msgid "Automate light and dark theme switching"
msgstr "Automatizējiet gaišā un tumšā motīva pārslēgšanu"

#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.metainfo.xml.in:13
msgid ""
"Switchcraft follows the light and dark style of GNOME and KDE Plasma. On "
"every switch it runs your shell commands and applies per-theme settings such "
"as the wallpaper, icon, GTK and Kvantum themes. Applications that do not "
"follow the system style stay in sync."
msgstr ""
"Switchcraft seko GNOME un KDE Plasma gaišajam un tumšajam stilam. Katrā "
"pārslēgšanās reizē tas palaiž jūsu čaulas komandas un lieto katram motīvam "
"paredzētus iestatījumus, piemēram, ekrāntapeti, ikonu, GTK un Kvantum "
"motīvus. Tā arī lietotnes, kas neievēro sistēmas stilu, paliek saskaņotas."

#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.metainfo.xml.in:14
msgid ""
"It can also switch the style for you at sunset and sunrise or at custom "
"times."
msgstr ""
"Tas var arī pārslēgt stilu jūsu vietā saulrietā un saullēktā vai pielāgotos "
"laikos."

#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.metainfo.xml.in:41
msgid ""
"Built-in commands: pick a setting and a value from a list instead of typing "
"a command"
msgstr "Iebūvētās komandas: izvēlieties iestatījumu un vērtību no saraksta, nevis rakstiet komandu"

#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.metainfo.xml.in:42
msgid "KDE Plasma and Kvantum support"
msgstr "KDE Plasma un Kvantum atbalsts"

#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.metainfo.xml.in:43
msgid "Automatic switching at sunset and sunrise or at custom times"
msgstr "Automātiska pārslēgšana saulrietā un saullēktā vai pielāgotos laikos"

#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.metainfo.xml.in:44
msgid ""
"Redesigned command list with drag-and-drop reordering, command testing and "
"undo"
msgstr "Pārveidots komandu saraksts ar pārkārtošanu velkot, komandu testēšanu un atsaukšanu"

#: data/com.github.Switchcraft.metainfo.xml.in:45
msgid "Translated into 22 languages"
msgstr "Tulkots 22 valodās"

